        "created_at": "2014-09-01T04:37:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So Proletariat takes damage for each copy that gets hit by an area attack? &nbsp;That's rough. &nbsp;I thought he was more like Omnitron, only taking damage once from a particular attack.</p>",
